"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[5461],{5461:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/69507b3e7c6bde402ec75d848437ba5c.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Canmore Bupyeong Branch\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Cafe\\"\\n  address=\\"12 Bupyeong-daero, Bupyeong-gu, Incheon\\"\\n  rating=3.5\\n  tags=\\"cafe\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\n\\nVisiting Bupyeong after a long time, I saw that the familiar <mark>Canmore</mark> was still around.  \\nWith fond nostalgia, I went inside with my friends without hesitation.  \\n\\nRiding the wave of popularity for retro relics that I personally find hard to fathom, `Canmore` is surprisingly considered a hot spot among younger people.  \\nWhen we actually went, there was a wait, and most of the patrons were young.  \\nIt seemed there were more customers visiting for a fresh new experience rather than reminiscing over old memories like us.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nThe nostalgic <mark>swing</mark> was still there.  \\nSeeing it again after so long brought back a lot of happy feelings.  \\nThe `snow shaved ice` and `parfait` were still on the menu, and just looking at the menu reminded me of the old days.  \\n\\nThe `unlimited toast refill` that was essential back then was also available when ordering one menu item per person.  \\n\\nIt was great to relive old memories after a long time.  \\nIt\'s a place I\'d love to visit again whenever I think of the past.  \\n\\n## Pictures\\n\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/69507b3e7c6bde402ec75d848437ba5c.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Canmore Bupyeong Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/10372f6af71e0d54a7f47d9a3ea6d919.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Canmore Bupyeong Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/a96d947976f75a1f94317d36f9841e4c.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Canmore Bupyeong Branch\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);